      "widgets": [
        {
          "id": "sc-header",
          "type": "markdown",
          "title": "Service Catalog",
          "markdown": "## Service Catalog\n\nAll services registered with the AI Software Factory Contract.\n\n**To add a new service:**\n1. Add `.factory/repository-contract.yaml` to your repo\n2. Create a `service` entity in Port (`pnpm factory port:apply`)\n3. Install the Producer GitHub App and configure branch protection with the Verifier App's `factory-contract/acceptance` check\n4. See the [Adopter Guide](https://github.com/Darshitpandya/ai-software-factory-contract#adopter-guide)\n\n| Property | Billing API | Notification API |\n|---|---|---|\n| Language | `TypeScript` | `Python` |\n| Compatibility check | OpenAPI (`oasdiff`) | JSON Schema (event fixtures) |\n| Security constraint | Tenant isolation | PII redaction |\n| Factory Release | `1.4.0` | `1.4.0` |"
        },
        {
          "id": "sc-t-all",
          "type": "table-entities-explorer",
          "title": "All Services",
          "displayMode": "widget",
          "dataset": {
            "combinator": "and",
            "rules": [
              {
                "operator": "=",
                "property": "$blueprint",
                "value": "service"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sc-p-lang",
          "type": "entities-pie-chart",
          "title": "Services by Language",
          "dataset": {
            "combinator": "and",
            "rules": [
              {
                "operator": "=",
                "property": "$blueprint",
                "value": "service"
              }
            ]
          },
          "property": "property#language"
        },
        {
          "id": "sc-p-tier",
          "type": "entities-pie-chart",
          "title": "Services by Tier",
          "dataset": {
            "combinator": "and",
            "rules": [
              {
                "operator": "=",
                "property": "$blueprint",
                "value": "service"
              }
            ]
          },
          "property": "property#tier"
        },
        {
          "id": "sc-b-lang",
          "type": "bar-chart",
          "title": "Language Distribution",
          "blueprint": "service",
          "dataset": {
            "combinator": "and",
            "rules": [
              {
                "operator": "=",
                "property": "$blueprint",
                "value": "service"
              }
            ]
          },
          "property": "property#language"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
